U.S. Bureau of Reclamation. Excitation Systems for Hydroelectric Units, FIST 3-14, January 2026 catalogue revision. [Official catalogue](https://www.usbr.gov/power/data/fist_pub.html) · [Complete linked manual](https://www.usbr.gov/power/data/fist/FIST_3-14_%2801-2026%29.pdf).

Read the whole manual during excitation/control study. Relate the synchronous-machine model, voltage/reactive control, limits, equipment, measurements and maintenance/testing evidence. Compare a simplified regulator block diagram with the installed sensing, limiters, auxiliary supplies and failure behavior.

The official catalogue identifies this current listed revision; checked on 29 October 2026. Direct retrieval timed out, so complete contents/page inspection and a precise internal issue history are not claimed. Preserve the actual file's notices and check newer revisions when applying it. Reclamation/hydroelectric context matters; an introductory transfer function is not a complete commissioning or protection method. No manual, controller model, settings or test data is copied here.

